{title: Jeev Rangala}
{artist: Jogwa Hariharan Ajay Atul Shreya Ghoshal}
{key: Bm}

{c: Verse 1}
Jeev [Bm]dangala gungala,        rangala a [Em]sa
[Em]Piramachi aas [Bm],        tu.. [F#]ou
Jeev [Bm]lagala laabhala,        Dhyass ho tu [Em]za
[Em]Gahiwarala shwas,        [Bm]tu.. [F#]ou
[Bm]Pailti [F#]ra neshil,        [Bm]Saath ma [F#]la deshil
[E]Kalij [E7]majha [F#]tu,        [Bm]Sukh bhara [F#]tila aala
[Bm]Nabh dhara [F#]tila aala,        [E]Punawa [E7]cha chand [F#]tu
Jeev [Bm]dangala gungala,        [Bm]rangala a [Em]sa
[Em]Piramachi aas [Bm]tu..        Chand [Bm]sugandha deil
Raat [Bm]usasa deil,        Sari [E]dharati tu [F#]jhi
Ruja [Bm]vya [F#]chi [E],        ma [F#]ti [Bm]tu
Khula [Bm]aabhal dhagaal,        tyala [Bm]rudhi cha vital
Majhya [E]raagh saja [F#]na,        Hee [Bm]kaka [F#]nachi
[E]tod [F#]maal [Bm]tu,        Khula [Bm]kalija he
[E]majhe Tula [E],        dila mi aan [F#]dan
Tujhya [Bm]payav [E]makhin,        majhya [E]janmacha gon [F#]than
